TI  - Estimating the number of infections and the impact of non-pharmaceutical interventions on COVID-19 in European countries: technical description update
AU  - Seth Flaxman
AU  - Swapnil Mishra
AU  - Axel Gandy
AU  - H. Juliette T. Unwin
AU  - Helen Coupland
AU  - Thomas A. Mellan
AU  - Harrison Zhu
