TI  - Development of a rat physiologically based kinetic model (PBK) for three organophosphate flame retardants (TDCIPP, TCIPP, TCEP)
AU  - Deepika Deepika
AU  - Raju Prasad Sharma
AU  - Marta Schuhmacher
