AB  - Software project schedule management is one of the important parts of
project management, which plays an important role in whether the project
can be completed on time. In this paper, the Monte Carlo method is used
to model the project schedule of a company's human resource management
system, and the probability distribution of project schedule is
obtained, so as to improve the reliability of project schedule
prediction. It provides a reliable basis for the correct implementation
of the plan and the control of the project duration.
