AB  - The control of software project schedule has been the emphasis and
difficulty of software project management. Many software companies are
focus on qualitative predicting and controlling of project schedule.
Lacking of quantitative prediction of project schedule, it is difficult
to quantitatively manage project schedule effectively. The paper
proposes solutions for the problems of quantitatively predicting and
controlling project schedule, and mines controllable factors that affect
the schedule in each phase of project. The paper uses AHP method to
select the key Schedule Factors, and establishes the relationship
between the key Schedule Factors and the schedule variance. Finally, the
paper combines Monte Carlo simulation method with software Process
Performance Model, which is built by those key Schedule Factors, to
create project schedule variance forecasting model. The paper adjusts
the Schedule Factors in the predicting model to achieve the controlling
of project schedule.
