AB  - Software development is a dynamic and complex process as there are many
interacting factors throughout the lifecycle that impact cost, schedule
and quality of the software project management. In addition, software
industry constantly faces increasing demands for quality, productivity,
and time-to-market, thus making the management of software projects one
of the most difficult and challenging tasks in any software
organization. Therefore, it is not surprising, that project management
is one of the focus areas to which process simulation techniques based
on System Dynamics (SD) have been applied in the domain of software
