AB  - Across the landscape of high technology companies, knowledge is a vital
core resource at the heart of the organization. The technological
complexity is steadily rising, tightening the global demands which are
leading to an aggravating conflict on the product: it has to be produced
faster, cheaper, more customer related and all without failures, while
the change of complexity is inviting new unseen potentials for faults.
On top, a new need for an agile production is arising. While todays
