AB  - The article describes the software development for charged tracks and
primary vertex reconstruction for the SPD [1] experiment at the future
NICA collider (JINR, Dubna). The use of these programs makes it possible
to quickly simulate various configurations of both the magnetic field
and the track system of the SPD experiment and, thus, determine the
