AB  - Based on the analysis of the structure characteristics of high-speed
wheel engineering equipment, a design method for virtual support
training systems was presented, founded on virtual reality (VR),
software engineering, process simulation technology. According to the
function requirements, the system software and hardware platform were
established. Combined with practical teaching needs, virtual support
system of high-speed wheel engineering equipment was developed. The
practice demonstrates that the system has high practical value and
guiding significance on the aspects of talents cultivation, the teaching
application, science research, etc.
