AB  - We propose a flexible process language (FLEX) to specify both process
model and meta-process model within a uniform framework based on process
ontology. A process ontology and some kernel meta-activities are
presented as the fundament for process support, such as modeling,
enaction and evolution. In contrast to other process languages that only
can evolve process model while encoding meta-process logic within PSEEs,
our approach can also evolve meta-process model for adjusting process
support mechanism flexibly.
