AB  - P-Lingua is a programming language for membrane computing. It was first
presented in Edinburgh, during the Ninth Workshop on Membrane Computing
(WMC9). In this paper, the models, simulators and formats included in
P-Lingua in version 2.0 are explained. We focus on the stochastic model,
